Missing one day is an accident. Missing two days is the start of a new habit.
The first rule of habit recovery is to never miss twice. When you miss, the goal is to get back on track as quickly as possible. A bad workout is infinitely better than a skipped workout.','Atomic Habits (James Clear)','{"habit-formation","behavior-change"}','{"never","miss","twice","missing","accident","days","start","habit","first","rule","recovery","goal","back","track","quickly"}','[-0.01406764,-0.048918,0.02293179,0.02763487,0.00166757,-0.03921146,-0.0567194,0.17706268,0.08565342,-0.05025222,-0.04575228,-0.0690278,-0.0558438,0.10050695,0.0906475,0.06902745,0.02170758,0.0436689,-0.05948628,0.01045052,-0.01610374,0.00883451,-0.08800795,0.0868367,-0.03347299,-0.03628174,0.02070177,-0.06930187,-0.12343972,-0.0179625,-0.00482339,-0.02783879,-0.06978424,-0.04251303,0.05757026,-0.01925337,0.05795252,0.02099076,0.06912399,0.02850935,-0.04448227,0.08360302,-0.06086263,-0.06621531,-0.0394972,0.00670986,0.03317503,0.02533913,0.08591723,-0.0898695,-0.03839367,0.11268203,0.07641929,-0.01370512,-0.00932804,0.01205344,-0.03338818,-0.0209988,0.02951239,-0.03200696,-0.01258258,0.02274942,-0.06914768,0.09172823,0.00062903,-0.02268097,-0.06008746,-0.00323804,-0.08607071,-0.03702686,0.13949774,0.04065961,-0.04390867,0.00843508,0.03085798,-0.03671031,-0.06390605,0.02158399,-0.00715113,0.0165361,-0.07070582,-0.01063489,0.02803794,-0.01418997,-0.07050849,0.00042289,-0.01217662,0.01920305,-0.05205138,0.02716489,-0.07534627,0.02498542,-0.0441815,0.00269296,0.07942504,0.04185739,-0.03065747,0.0089718,0.00188852,0.04575643,0.00590043,-0.00010269,0.01649932,-0.03040515,-0.05309112,0.01534849,0.11930922,-0.06659936,0.00784746,0.02326872,0.01828542,0.02586421,-0.01497766,-0.03426441,0.01449428,0.05778899,0.09114773,-0.11062951,-0.01120729,0.05012546,-0.041897,0.00791662,0.05766362,0.0414919,-0.01576619,-0.03560541,-0.02100601,-0.00210008,0.01831914,0.02947897,0.01132957,0.02230072,-0.03264103,0.03301659,0.00367181,0.02322239,0.01225906,-0.02113866,0.00504741,-0.03460735,0.00308178,-0.049719