INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('785ba544-f924-4137-826a-5732e707f3b0','md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-the-forgetting-curve-ebbinghaus-and-intervention-p','The Forgetting Curve (Ebbinghaus) and Intervention Points

Without review, retention falls along a negatively accelerating exponential curve:
- 1 hour: ~56% retained
- 1 day: ~34% retained
- 1 week: ~23% retained
- 1 month: ~21% retained (levels off — long-term memory threshold)

Each successful retrieval resets the forgetting curve to a flatter slope. After 3-4 successful reviews with appropriate spacing, the material approaches long-term stable memory.

The practical implication: the first review must happen within 24 hours of initial learning. This is the single highest-value intervention in any spaced repetition system. Miss the 24-hour review window, and retention at 1 week drops by approximately 40% compared to reviewed-at-24-hours condition.','cepeda-spaced-repetition','{"habit-formation"}','{"forgetting","curve","ebbinghaus","intervention","points","without","review","retention","falls","along","negatively","accelerating","exponential","hour","retained"}','[0.05286234,-0.06150035,-0.05495357,0.08085591,-0.02240827,-0.01157227,-0.11532187,0.12887622,0.06836738,-0.00214774,-0.06090698,-0.08154204,-0.08429588,0.13920295,0.05989278,0.06913511,0.04793386,0.05052415,0.02191218,0.04152605,0.00200465,0.06484796,-0.01169717,0.072847,-0.0932779,0.06258601,-0.09241377,-0.08377865,-0.08586076,0.06767008,0.00592552,-0.05879689,-0.090443,-0.01468716,0.03118233,-0.0288274,0.07079084,-0.02018582,0.02888949,-0.0212962,-0.02506031,0.05149818,0.00240057,0.03306574,0.06241245,0.02134246,0.01456216,0.05313267,-0.02020517,-0.03417399,0.01578834,0.12315675,-0.06218549,0.10856924,-0.04599822,0.0882877,0.06295744,-0.01648303,0.03954988,-0.00947423,-0.00379242,0.01944697,-0.04111621,-0.00076039,0.00255009,-0.02107619,0.0865588,0.0372103,-0.06274918,-0.03080257,0.09359374,-0.01006847,-0.01737131,0.08107298,-0.02103488,-0.0144702,-0.01249028,0.05682076,0.02046634,-0.11839396,0.05707308,-0.07182157,0.0477269,0.05370487,-0.04593636,0.02692571,-0.12289975,-0.00387567,0.02968738,-0.06264634,-0.03872602,0.03895338,-0.10505993,0.0608349,0.01175571,-0.05278599,0.02140826,-0.01066259,-0.00966437,0.03964024,-0.00840341,0.02498968,0.00841101,0.00998217,0.00586051,-0.01819533,0.05842742,0.00635757,0.02761138,-0.00927283,-0.02119576,-0.00276552,-0.07612983,-0.01394439,0.07030769,0.07623567,-0.02047977,-0.00627153,0.00769481,0.05260914,0.05906878,-0.02332938,0.03738007,0.04505513,-0.05419916,-0.02356015,0.0374513,-0.0179276,0.0291462,0.00627057,0.04