INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('bd7cb1bd-2342-417c-b7a2-8eb300ce3092','md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-application-to-habit-learning-and-curriculum-desig','Application to Habit Learning and Curriculum Design

### The Non-Negotiable First Rule
Review new content within 24 hours of first exposure. This single rule produces the largest single retention improvement available.

In curriculum design: if Monday is a new concept day, Tuesday must include a retrieval practice component on Monday''s material, regardless of what else is scheduled.

### The Weekly Spaced Review Template
Optimal schedule for a 5-day learning week:
```
Day 1 (Monday):    New concept introduction — encoding session
Day 2 (Tuesday):   Active retrieval on Day 1 content (24-hour review — highest value)
Day 3 (Wednesday): New concept OR extension of Day 1 with application
Day 4 (Thursday):  Mixed retrieval: Day 1 + Day 3 material (3-4 day spacing for Day 1)
Day 5 (Friday):    New concept or deliberate practice challenge
Day 6 (Saturday):  Week review: all concepts interleaved (7-day spacing for Monday material)
Day 7 (Sunday):    Rest — hippocampal consolidation occurs primarily during offline periods
```

### For Minimal Time Budgets (15 min/day)
Daily cognitive load is too low to introduce AND review on the same day. Alternate:
- Mon/Wed/Fri: New micro-concept (encoding only)
- Tue/Thu/Sat: Active retrieval on previous day''s concept
- Sunday: Rest

This structure respects working memory limits while maintaining the 24-hour review window.

### Retention Interval Adjustment for Habit Skills
Habit skills (procedural memory) follow different consolidation dynamics than declarative memory (facts). Key differences:
- Procedural memory consolidates primarily during sleep (motor cortex offline reprocessing)
- Spaced practice with sleep between sessions is critical for motor skill automaticity
- Massed practice in a single day is LESS effective than the same repetitions distributed across days

Implication: for skill-based goals (languages, instruments, physical skills), the curriculum should never schedule 2+ hour continuous sessions as superior to two 1-hour sessions on different days.','cepeda-spaced-repetition','{"habit-formation"}','{"application","habit","learning","curriculum","design","non-negotiable","first","rule","review","content","within","hours","exposure","single","produces"}','[0.06409796,0.02090841,0.06691064,0.04499109,-0.04912449,-0.04450465,-0.16887994,0.06685834,0.10701416,-0.12855193,-0.0749082,-0.04493613,-0.0610522,0.09674746,0.08604946,0.0418788,-0.02216759,0.04658829,0.00347989,-0.05421774,-0.0653378,0.00885891,-0.09311586,0.11954769,0.00239003,-0.00773226,-0.06938462,-0.08632472,-0.04286816,0.01343319,0.01734168,-0.03693362,-0.09800763,-0.0021548,0.02161701,-0.02599258,0.12521407,0.03108349,0.07464305,-0.0269123,-0.02003286,0.07663694,-0.02843235,0.0883174,0.01482829,0.02065579,0.01493842,-0.00821107,0.00083541,-0.0691166,-0.02382563,0.15247416,0.07289723,0.01366254,-0.01278749,0.05506247,0.07877232,-0.07453168,0.02581037,0.02100972,0.0374274,-0.0206281,0.02928503,0.02521092,-0.00760454,-0.03553096,0.02254851,0.03846477,-0.07732632,-0.08077203,0.10033428,-0.0378715,0.02231203,0.01783215,-0.01259719,-0.02214738,-0.0129728,0.03920745,-0.0140659,-0.0595167,-0.010482,-0.08286485,0.08796169,0.02344628,-0.07369956,0.02146515,-0.08508296,0.00281821,-0.01188096,-0.07359327,-0.04886717,-0.00437168,-0.08376657,0.0124261,0.05938426,0.01769083,-0.00060334,0.00719952,-0.02684476,0.05765194,-0.00248411,0.04886018,0.02846107,0.01281598,0.0222159,-0.03964433,0.11380645,0.00548756,-0.04599603,-0.01782819,0.01569746,0.0044665,0.0019167,-0.04361767,0.02286773,0.03053003,0.00639209,-0.05120228,-0.00752182,0.03273299,0.00482274,0.0153108,-0.01183845,0.0594233,-0.05392918,-0.02241168,0.01085362,0.03278698,0.01871382,-0.02161794,0.042514,0.06630989,-0.00241002,0.06565669,0.03802432,0.02092059,-0.0508925,-0.02942682,-0.0146656,-0.00767965,0.10236566,-0.