- Course completion addiction: Finishing a course is not a skill. Building something is.
- Learning the comfortable parts: You naturally practice what you''re already good at.
- No feedback loop: Practice without feedback produces confident incompetence.
- Building for the portfolio not the skill: Build what stretches you, not what looks impressive.','Coheren Domain KB — Skill Development','{"skill-progression","career"}','{"common","pitfalls","course","completion","addiction","finishing","skill","building","something","learning","comfortable","parts","naturally","practice","what"}','[0.06141817,-0.11684883,0.06434321,0.00056618,-0.0216866,0.04652938,-0.0561381,0.08855138,-0.02149384,0.0240638,-0.00297699,-0.10419929,0.02223784,0.07532319,0.16035068,0.05947199,0.02002265,0.03316649,0.00572236,0.02656972,-0.09380662,0.07856758,0.05076418,0.0821319,0.00905951,-0.11575851,-0.10556912,-0.05796992,-0.01153823,-0.0503221,0.13537037,0.07282955,-0.07175309,0.06565529,-0.00306262,-0.07157306,0.08848439,0.06607497,0.03682812,0.03079749,-0.03146683,0.03572004,-0.0548162,-0.0087207,-0.01925389,0.02965053,0.03703133,-0.00801652,0.03234943,-0.06666937,-0.01237948,0.02762141,-0.00298751,-0.02418017,-0.01141066,0.06687438,-0.00381434,-0.00949156,0.07724626,-0.02519444,-0.0042548,-0.0123104,0.04713546,-0.03832211,-0.12775663,-0.04608687,-0.02121058,-0.04290471,-0.07913814,-0.02631304,0.09604963,0.0538691,0.01234992,0.03149131,0.03483142,-0.08478955,-0.03403678,-0.06538068,-0.01264322,-0.00198317,-0.04406353,-0.02524739,0.10006787,-0.01937334,0.05375165,-0.03185275,-0.00756226,0.02592008,-0.06870043,0.09677958,-0.04429677,0.02796777,0.0391423,-0.02926414,0.01584643,-0.02289025,0.06689286,-0.05570959,0.03463059,0.00212684,-0.02237437,-0.00283273,-0.07294101,-0.0440161,0.01176289,-0.01026446,0.01672686,-0.03536517,-0.01529345,0.01465449,-0.02351554,-0.03106526,0.06205248,-0.02539519,-0.03786545,0.04693688,0.08046754,-0.01674451,0.00464175,0.00202587,-0.05614245,-0.0188939,0.04030943,0.04528978,-0.00109284,-0.04647992,-0.04968339,-0.03859657,-0.01577043,0.03123544,0.00739676,0.04276928,0.00484908,0.05680684,0.0038866,-0.02950305,-0.00876174,-0.03718227,-0.01076592,-0.03879125,0.02045458,-0.00669349,0.06152526,-0.04861696,-0.06034286,-0.