INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('0c7e84d4-e4f0-4205-a042-84817b5286fb','md-confidence-building-understanding-low-confidence','Understanding Low Confidence

Confidence is domain-specific, not a global trait. Someone can be highly confident at work and have low confidence socially. This means confidence is built through domain-specific competence development and track record accumulation.

Confidence ≠ absence of self-doubt. High-performing people across all domains report self-doubt — but they act in spite of it, and those actions build competence, which builds confidence over time.

The confidence-competence loop:
Competence → small wins → confidence → attempt harder things → more competence → more confidence

The loop starts with competence, not confidence. "Fake it till you make it" is partially true — taking action despite low confidence produces the competence that eventually produces real confidence.','Coheren Coaching KB — Confidence','{"coaching","motivation"}','{"understanding","confidence","domain-specific","global","trait","someone","highly","confident","work","socially","means","built","through","competence","development"}','[-0.00066646,-0.06798301,-0.04139395,-0.1335432,0.10013806,0.0126947,-0.05709517,0.08141623,-0.05090723,-0.01325177,0.00763402,-0.03659958,0.02360011,0.07542941,0.12013513,0.10646049,0.01151775,0.01510783,0.04889443,0.00936044,-0.01112942,0.03054478,0.11616636,-0.00939331,-0.03748985,-0.02740905,-0.05497711,0.07852068,-0.00865372,-0.05809752,0.10769521,-0.06118756,-0.02345255,0.12253525,0.01688724,-0.09605902,0.04444282,0.02801497,-0.0008295,-0.00155386,-0.00908152,0.03960407,0.03480905,-0.00231581,0.0293023,0.08578731,0.08037445,-0.01743582,0.04070004,-0.0505,0.02705111,0.02004055,-0.02270539,0.02026033,-0.03076749,-0.07604286,0.0655309,-0.03718684,0.0386462,-0.00388765,0.01823795,0.00462321,-0.01412832,0.01882983,-0.08592045,0.00492609,0.04254874,-0.08199181,-0.12062471,-0.02985789,0.03128446,0.02037332,-0.02709447,0.06253732,0.04220129,0.04437584,-0.03060128,0.00978264,-0.04445494,-0.00707529,-0.03541984,-0.04753117,-0.0049346,0.02081861,0.03149957,-0.07473855,-0.00886449,-0.01090014,0.0293349,0.01195872,-0.03831586,0.0279658,0.08908626,0.00875925,-0.0508953,-0.01331728,0.07519658,0.04398325,0.0302788,-0.02879778,0.02446201,0.08213359,0.01033503,-0.01891564,0.01534462,0.0476467,0.01349876,-0.02810846,0.0539494,0.0183715,-0.03531362,0.10411097,-0.00752529,-0.00333882,-0.07725696,0.02843513,0.02880772,-0.06363754,-0.03116741,0.00322607,-0.05823116,0.07105158,-0.02654701,0.14688867,0.02580164,0.01583658,-0.06058916,-0.02122002,-0.02546266,0.05163108,-0.01138372,-0.02163376,0.02718857,0.02692381,0.05943149,0.02560583,0.04200582,0.00118074,0.