INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('5905a1d9-841a-4a57-bf5e-b6c096a0f8f1','md-confidence-building-you-already-know-this-connections','"You Already Know This" Connections

Every new skill is built on skills already acquired. Making this explicit builds confidence.

Protocol (for curriculum design): every new task explicitly references 1-2 things the person already knows that this task builds on.
- "Today''''s task uses the same logical structure as the variables lesson from Day 3"
- "This running drill uses the same breathing pattern you established last week"
