INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('33ff989c-0caa-42fa-b24b-85aefb4c5a59','md-freelancing-phase-2-first-client-acquisition-weeks-5-10','Phase 2: First Client Acquisition (Weeks 5–10)

Most first freelance clients come from warm network, not cold outreach. Start there.

Warm outreach sequence:
- Week 5: Message 20 people you know — previous colleagues, classmates, friends in business
- Message template: "I''''ve started freelancing as a [specific role]. I''''m looking for my first paid project — do you know anyone who might need [specific service]? Even a referral would be amazing."
- Don''t sell directly to warm contacts — ask for referrals

Cold outreach (after warm network is exhausted):
- Identify 10 businesses that could benefit from your service but clearly don''t have it
- Research each one (2 hours) before reaching out
- Send a personalized, specific message: "I noticed [specific thing on their website/social]. I''''ve helped similar businesses with [specific result]. Would you be open to a 20-minute conversation?"
- Volume required: 20 cold messages to produce 1-2 responses at typical rates

Freelance platforms (as supplemental, not primary):
- Upwork, Fiverr — high competition, price pressure, race to bottom
- Better: niche communities (Slack groups, Discord, subreddits, industry forums) where clients congregate

Discovery call structure:
- 30 min maximum
- First 15 min: ask about their problem, goals, past attempts, budget range
- Last 15 min: explain how you''d approach it, next steps
- Never pitch during the discovery call — gather information, send the proposal after

Milestone: First paid project signed. Even $200. The psychological threshold is everything.','Coheren Domain KB — Freelancing','{"skill-progression","career"}','{"phase","first","client","acquisition","weeks","most","freelance","clients","come","warm","network","cold","outreach","start","there"}','[0.00119007,-0.04790062,0.06590754,-0.04131125,0.03058947,0.09524034,-0.14014614,0.02212887,0.03120447,-0.07648306,-0.02585201,0.03334976,0.12755461,0.0844194,0.02695996,0.04412859,-0.02467985,0.08770084,0.07705776,-0.01182808,-0.07410868,-0.05532877,-0.0865245,0.00035924,-0.10887101,-0.05296504,-0.02766983,-0.00978099,-0.06238542,-0.03379935,0.02947433,0.07645413,-0.01598185,0.09301076,-0.03551296,-0.01091812,-0.03798316,0.13367003,0.00028655,0.0567711,-0.00545328,0.01809794,0.02197203,0.07614774,-0.01365195,0.00674531,0.01851133,-0.00426561,0.1062548,-0.01700218,-0.00888432,0.06025638,0.02502577,0.02217445,-0.00977364,0.0565523,0.04244202,-0.08094288,0.05689286,-0.04892916,-0.10473388,0.1261738,0.07676672,0.02718349,-0.00266673,-0.05363036,-0.04258782,0.02921085,-0.04616037,0.01502682,0.05274,0.00013309,0.03834188,0.09157648,0.0372926,-0.03500341,0.03395075,-0.05502969,-0.06514853,-0.00917972,-0.05182563,3.787e-05,-0.00305261,0.10348083,0.06671052,0.01410166,0.00200951,0.04897862,0.0841747,0.01097387,-0.0032565,-0.02513823,-0.05536531,-0.0008731,0.04669885,-0.02178668,-0.02970083,0.05091407,-0.02147947,0.02942614,0.05349751,0.02958311,0.00298172,0.01533138,-0.02981589,0.06294468,0.02122871,0.01808564,0.03166611,-0.03350044,-0.02077556,-0.02392261,-0.01233925,-0.08022822,0.02624346,0.04187353,-0.00146291,-0.00533411,-0.05995368,0.01071242,0.02666073,0.0012478,0.01029302,-0.00448382,0.03753075,0.0569026,-0.04018734,0.0511869,0.02515711,-0.01448463,-0.00846414,0.01842692,0.02647066,0.02321543,0.00516006,0.0154243,-0.00910382,-0.01025555,-0.02782721,-0.00554194,-0.0062708,-0.0046649,0.07728128,-0.03990254,-0.04428607,0.0049718,0.01722639,0.01039122,0.05565874,0.01536604,-0.0