INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('933206c1-60d8-4288-9ec3-3afe612d3fcd','md-fear-of-failure-protocols-process-vs-outcome-goals','Process vs. Outcome Goals

Outcome goals ("win the race," "get an A," "be selected") are largely outside your control — they depend on others, randomness, and circumstances. Process goals ("run 4 training sessions this week," "study 2 hours per day," "submit the application") are entirely within your control.

Redirect focus from outcomes to process:
- "Did I complete my planned practice?" (Yes/No — binary, achievable)
