INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('70c951bc-1e44-4cca-855b-a82bb80e454a','md-perfectionism-breaking-ship-it-gate-for-career-creative-contexts','"Ship It" Gate for Career/Creative Contexts

For creative and career-related work, the perfectionist needs a forcing function for release/publication.

Ship-it gate definition: a hard criterion that triggers publication regardless of subjective readiness.

Examples:
- "When the draft is 1000 words and has a beginning, middle, and end — it goes to the editor"
- "When the portfolio has 3 pieces — it goes live"
- "When the code passes the tests — it gets submitted for review"
- "When the application is submitted — I am done with it (no more tweaking)"

The gate criterion is defined in advance, not in the moment. In the moment, the perfectionist always finds a reason it needs "just a little more work."','Coheren Coaching KB — Perfectionism','{"coaching","behavior-change"}','{"ship","gate","career","creative","contexts","career-related","work","perfectionist","needs","forcing","function","release","publication","ship-it","definition"}','[0.05924148,-0.07345721,0.12571917,-0.03124335,0.07457648,0.12100577,-0.07655386,0.11173125,0.06475323,-0.00967288,-0.07826528,0.09206666,-0.00418775,-0.03363725,0.0244416,0.00790942,0.04602918,0.08684368,0.04192625,-0.0409448,0.01559879,0.01750639,0.02234118,0.1145021,-0.07675306,0.0520902,-0.00482263,0.05857432,0.07771149,-0.00226935,0.12607004,0.08125779,-0.07203049,0.04627466,-0.02946796,0.00120525,-0.06104749,-0.019789,-0.02661098,0.00620395,0.00255471,-0.00316545,0.04938372,-0.01145114,-0.09651211,-0.03314531,-0.01687772,0.02423439,0.01468407,0.04852366,0.0831989,0.02703629,0.02636175,-0.07594288,0.13261418,0.04274888,-0.00688991,-0.02719142,-0.05591599,-0.0894812,-0.01894871,-0.0421376,0.01059429,-0.04795484,-0.02972781,-0.09395511,0.00707457,-0.00540395,-0.02456518,0.00255761,0.00693602,0.08872249,0.0392964,-0.03037876,0.02140286,-0.09008941,0.06474676,-0.05326843,0.01037277,-0.00320043,-0.03585348,0.01945946,0.07585584,0.05466197,0.00986155,-0.02045864,-0.08334789,0.03104295,-0.03289257,0.07877047,0.03811459,0.00432914,0.01002842,-0.01769493,-0.04627721,0.00564835,-0.02320759,0.04858812,0.0037602,0.00880028,0.02897911,0.0453852,-0.10524814,-0.00209128,-0.00518876,-0.01835099,0.06225619,-0.00787762,-0.00921854,-0.00809468,0.01968516,0.00660437,0.01323761,0.00665284,0.03242548,-0.07536008,-0.02318802,-0.00059351,0.02695737,0.00739308,0.03602955,0.04672316,-0.09021455,-0.00358842,0.00326453,-0.02200839,-0.004152,0.0300541,0.00317701,0.03100259,0.00426734,0.04601871,-0.02575267,-0.01884959,-0.0057515,0.07882638,-0.01778607,-0.01677282,0.0024818,0.04727393,-0.05103884,-0.00157574