INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('0d2e1cf9-4529-475a-8bbb-5cc07c69caa3','md-weight-loss-phase-1-measurement-and-foundation-weeks-1-3','Phase 1: Measurement and Foundation (Weeks 1–3)

Weight loss is driven by one variable: sustained caloric deficit over time. But sustainable deficit requires understanding personal baseline and building habits that don''t require constant willpower.

Baseline measurement:
- TDEE (Total Daily Energy Expenditure): use a calculator (Mifflin-St Jeor formula + activity multiplier)
- Track everything you eat for 7 days WITHOUT changing anything — just observe
- Most people underestimate daily intake by 20-40% before tracking
- Target deficit: 300-500 calories per day — produces 0.3-0.5 kg (0.6-1 lb) loss per week

Weight tracking correctly:
- Weigh daily, first thing in morning, after bathroom, before eating
- Track weekly average, not daily number (daily fluctuations of 1-2 kg from water, food, and hormones are normal)
- Progress photos every 4 weeks — the scale doesn''t capture body composition changes

Protein priority:
- Protein is the most important macro during fat loss
- Target: 1.6-2.2g per kg of bodyweight per day
- Protein increases satiety, preserves muscle mass during deficit, and has highest thermic effect (25% of protein calories burned in digestion)
- Practical: 30-40g protein at every main meal

Week 1: Tracking and baseline only
- Log every food and drink in MyFitnessPal or Cronometer
- No food restrictions yet — just visibility
- Milestone: 7 consecutive days of logging. Know your average daily caloric intake.

Week 2–3: Introduce deficit
- Reduce intake by 300-400 calories from baseline (not all at once — reduce by 100 cal every 3 days)
- Prioritize protein: if protein is low, increase it before reducing anything else
- Milestone: Deficit maintained for 7 days. Weekly weight average compared to week 1.','Coheren Domain KB — Weight Loss','{"skill-progression","health"}','{"phase","measurement","foundation","weeks","weight","loss","driven","variable","sustained","caloric","deficit","over","time","sustainable","requires"}','[0.01372672,0.01201889,-0.04016819,0.02777495,-0.05823007,-0.03889739,-0.12066335,-0.01268359,-0.02081893,-0.04730829,-0.09203098,-0.02676653,-0.11990016,0.00267682,0.09551156,0.03536616,0.02727755,0.15465358,0.10606784,-0.0967677,-0.1062521,-0.10726871,-0.0204442,0.10728501,-0.07595824,0.01912752,-0.05105812,-0.02081284,-0.05483077,-0.04630589,0.01622487,0.00182975,-0.04516724,0.06574119,-0.01359454,-0.02904498,0.07380973,0.07626758,0.00285101,0.09802532,0.0852918,0.07150948,-0.00546808,-0.00501295,0.00140185,-0.03586393,0.08516923,-0.07997734,0.02651193,-0.07792635,0.00691191,0.11933617,0.00329851,0.08903021,-0.10550249,0.04839776,-0.05029214,-0.05042341,-0.03997891,-0.032152,-0.08256671,-0.02966813,-0.02436299,-0.00043396,0.01493404,-0.02714994,-0.02360599,0.04757833,-0.01875558,0.00180634,0.06492024,0.00784563,0.05692613,0.06522579,-0.02043385,0.03002074,0.02036043,-0.02419935,0.01016147,0.04940361,-0.05721208,0.04091053,-0.04999761,0.01476585,0.01948909,0.05082857,0.00213042,0.04166221,-0.02854203,-0.00621993,0.06044598,0.05954061,-0.07360754,-0.01085753,0.01768263,0.01327727,0.03114299,-0.00942214,-0.0471467,-0.00455909,-0.03523542,0.00473254,0.03015878,-0.04611494,-0.00349113,-0.02418933,0.10708968,-0.02982355,-0.04197446,-0.05950914,0.00164678,0.02996195,-0.00361733,0.00504731,0.04752528,0.06755257,0.00748277,-0.02554149,-0.01922693,0.05448855,-0.0125239,-5.512e-05,0.01604061,0.02173994,0.07759085,-0.03550287,0.04502176,0.00028485,0.03821217,0.01974442,0.05748941,0.08018553,0.01548886,0.00891629,0.05864105,0.02088299,0.02489955,0.00175027,-0.0122809,0.00866272,-0.0001686,0.02041313,-5.332e-05,0.04710396,-0.02866629,0.01441453,0.01815556,0.01335297,-0.0206