INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('08b5c121-799d-4dab-8b8a-e904170eaf84','md-weight-loss-phase-2-sustainable-habits-and-progress-weeks-4-12','Phase 2: Sustainable Habits and Progress (Weeks 4–12)

A deficit you can maintain for 90 days produces more results than a severe deficit maintained for 10 days. Sustainability > intensity.

Food strategies that reduce hunger without counting (after baseline understanding):
- Volume eating: fill half the plate with non-starchy vegetables (low calorie, high fiber, high volume)
- Protein first: eat protein before carbohydrates in every meal (reduces total intake naturally)
- Eliminate liquid calories: juice, soda, alcohol, and fancy coffees can account for 500+ cal/day
- Whole foods over processed: whole foods are more filling per calorie than processed equivalents

Movement integration:
- Non-Exercise Activity Thermogenesis (NEAT): all movement outside formal exercise
- Target: 8,000-10,000 steps per day — this alone creates a meaningful caloric deficit
- Resistance training during fat loss: preserves muscle (muscle burns calories at rest — protect it)
- Cardio: useful but not required. 150 min/week moderate intensity is the evidence-based target.

Hunger management:
- Hunger is not an emergency. A 300-500 cal deficit will produce mild hunger at certain times — this is normal.
- Hunger peaks and passes: wait 20 minutes before eating in response to hunger
- High-fiber foods slow digestion and extend satiety: legumes, oats, vegetables, fruit
- Sleep: 7-8 hours reduces ghrelin (hunger hormone) and increases leptin (satiety hormone)

Plateau management:
- Weight loss plateaus are universal — they do not mean the diet stopped working
- First: verify tracking accuracy (people underestimate intake more during plateaus)
- Second: recalculate TDEE (weight loss reduces TDEE — fewer kg = fewer calories needed)
- Third: diet break for 2 weeks at maintenance (reduces metabolic adaptation)

Milestone: 4-week weight average is lower than the starting 4-week average. Habits (protein, logging, steps) are automatic.','Coheren Domain KB — Weight Loss','{"skill-progression","health"}','{"phase","sustainable","habits","progress","weeks","deficit","maintain","days","produces","more","results","severe","maintained","sustainability","intensity"}','[0.03612762,0.0121499,-0.00696095,-0.00185174,-0.06125469,-0.06924967,-0.11498034,0.06770943,-0.06250764,-0.08169817,-0.09730338,-0.04245455,-0.13924481,-0.02944472,0.05007415,0.02075717,0.00388917,0.15947762,0.0576186,-0.08241931,-0.08586132,-0.10752957,-0.06019583,0.06985186,-0.06146605,0.02127733,-0.02938245,-0.05440741,-0.063807,-0.09482174,0.08132534,0.01584551,-0.06876395,0.02494788,0.01198548,0.03839823,0.10671256,0.02751977,-0.00823885,0.08098754,0.04878623,0.02965014,-0.030943,-0.03855438,-0.03177705,-0.00038159,0.06702076,-0.09849638,0.0778548,-0.04844014,-0.00484705,0.1578399,-0.0023106,0.09603202,-0.09724252,0.05022647,-0.0516169,-0.02393295,-0.01854731,0.02388489,-0.06377895,-0.0074061,-0.01839149,0.01813876,0.03176929,-0.0397039,-0.02266779,0.03102461,-0.00588445,-0.03992469,0.08530522,0.01863309,0.01800327,0.07885262,0.01014411,-0.02600405,0.00994322,0.0226249,0.00970343,0.01131233,-0.01385201,0.01944397,-0.01024622,0.00437745,0.03356718,0.06901595,0.00480052,0.0053054,0.01882008,-0.03790544,0.01365201,0.0567137,-0.08046953,0.00383601,0.00975545,0.02159409,0.03235485,-0.00061752,-0.04444462,-0.01562952,-0.03591195,0.02010431,0.03382105,-0.0341096,-0.01180434,-0.0005012,0.12743872,-0.0224872,-0.07391187,-0.01764216,0.01406107,0.02877669,0.00337606,-0.01683694,0.01187798,0.01439502,0.02092956,-0.03244175,0.01258765,0.04998604,0.05136355,0.01514523,0.05976684,-0.00309592,0.05335015,-0.03891848,0.02693924,-0.02337484,-0.0221038,0.02214199,0.04775152,0.09211743,0.01053017,0.02114347,0.00996611,0.04429152,0.00664301,-0.07415649,0.03157264,-0.0077867,-0.01580497,0.00479829,-0.02398933,0.06995376,-0.0392962,-0.0