INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('b88a6e04-0669-4ac6-8d44-5d79acd3453a','md-weight-loss-phase-3-final-push-and-maintenance-transition-week','Phase 3: Final Push and Maintenance Transition (Weeks 13–24)

The last 20% of goal weight is the hardest: hunger hormones increase, metabolism adapts, and motivation wanes. The plan must anticipate this.

Advanced strategies for the final phase:
- Caloric cycling: eat at deficit 5 days, maintenance 2 days (psychological relief + metabolic adaptation prevention)
- Protein increase: as deficit continues, increase protein to 2.2-2.5g/kg to protect muscle
- Resistance training increase: heavier weights during fat loss phase preserves metabolic rate

Maintenance transition (critical — most people regain weight here):
- Do not stop all tracking immediately after reaching goal
- Increase calories by 100-150 per week until weight is stable (4-6 weeks)
- New maintenance calories are often 100-200 below original TDEE estimate (body adapts)
- Keep the habit structures: protein targets, vegetable intake, steps — these become your maintenance plan

Body recomposition (simultaneous fat loss and muscle gain):
- Possible for beginners and people returning from a break
- Requires: slight caloric deficit + heavy resistance training + high protein
- Progress is slower than either pure cutting or bulking but body composition improves

Milestone: Goal weight reached and maintained for 4 weeks. Maintenance calorie intake identified and stable.','Coheren Domain KB — Weight Loss','{"skill-progression","health"}','{"phase","final","push","maintenance","transition","weeks","last","goal","weight","hardest","hunger","hormones","increase","metabolism","adapts"}','[0.07529675,0.00417629,-0.05052751,0.01846292,-0.07023909,-0.08036979,-0.11609301,0.01035824,0.0166825,-0.10724285,-0.07257072,-0.05722281,-0.15870567,-0.02883962,0.07918762,0.03874686,0.03994023,0.12025325,0.12434931,-0.06869682,-0.04906927,-0.06308011,-0.05789868,0.09309647,-0.06629041,-0.02034212,-0.04374407,0.02713283,-0.01937758,-0.02828365,0.00080234,0.06292477,-0.0639782,0.02184541,0.04788676,-0.0136041,0.09803434,0.03474269,-0.03496696,0.06150676,0.03417523,0.02281635,-0.06561905,0.00192479,-0.03591043,-0.01477463,0.01453573,-0.08075254,0.01547538,-0.0237256,0.03465435,0.11488184,-0.05017575,0.07295093,-0.03217783,0.09684792,-0.04861834,-0.04426377,-0.02481307,-0.00484407,-0.07069443,-0.00566552,0.01485553,0.0377713,0.00629784,-0.03170222,0.01232819,0.00444039,0.01267746,0.02064766,0.12401608,0.07109341,0.08575819,0.08896299,-0.01073991,0.04378825,0.02788567,-0.02569176,-0.0001211,0.08355978,-0.06477945,0.01828624,-0.05929402,0.00742629,-0.00587634,0.04490419,-0.0176012,0.03258651,-0.00827445,0.01598463,0.03329705,0.04533551,-0.0409611,0.01127762,0.04516632,-0.02466766,0.04104075,-0.05011826,-0.02940605,-0.01713973,-0.01485442,0.0229226,-0.00097032,-0.07389181,-0.00480105,-0.009654,0.08648507,-0.01713067,-0.04790253,-0.01193593,-0.00531629,0.00795286,0.00634487,-0.00894009,0.08431793,0.02968892,-0.01383329,-0.02845525,0.05056335,0.10174378,0.04233994,-0.03604842,-0.01361535,0.02980896,0.04485274,0.01550223,0.03531598,-0.03290883,0.00533491,-0.05048679,0.02477826,0.06461371,-0.0098933,-0.02599525,0.01061009,-0.00123622,0.00818811,-0.00066313,-0.00722576,0.0113518,-0.0162917,0.04368341,0.02134895,0.06486618,-0.02462456,-0.02195393,0.0207946