INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('f33e9f22-0452-4e78-8c7a-854f2b792f11','md-morning-routine-phase-2-building-a-full-routine-weeks-3-8','Phase 2: Building a Full Routine (Weeks 3–8)

Add components one at a time — never add two new elements in the same week. Each new element needs 7 days of consistent execution before the next one is added.

Addition sequence (proven high-impact):
Week 3: Morning movement (10-20 min): walk, yoga, stretching, or workout
Week 4: Intentional planning (10 min): write 3 priorities for the day before checking any inbox
Week 5: Nutritional anchor (15 min): high-protein breakfast — protein at breakfast reduces afternoon cravings
Week 6: Learning or skill input (15-20 min): book, podcast, language study, skill practice
Week 7-8: Review and cut: remove any component that feels forced. Your routine should feel energizing, not like a checklist.

Environment design for morning routines:
- Prepare the night before: gym clothes out, journal open, coffee machine set to timer
- Each reduction in friction doubles the completion rate
- The routine starts the night before: "tomorrow morning I will wake at 6:30, make my bed, drink water, then go for a 15 min walk"

Time budget reality check:
- Most people overestimate available morning time
- Count backward from "need to leave" or "first commitment" time
- Leave 20 minutes of buffer — one disruption shouldn''t collapse the whole routine

Milestone: Complete 20-minute morning routine 5 of 7 days for 4 consecutive weeks.','Coheren Domain KB — Morning Routine','{"skill-progression","lifestyle"}','{"phase","building","full","routine","weeks","components","time","never","elements","same","week","each","element","needs","days"}','[0.03381361,0.05335668,0.02991468,0.02472639,-0.0271356,-0.05435263,-0.14101464,0.04615857,0.05796601,-0.19002151,-0.11407793,-0.02940478,-0.07098698,0.03104024,0.01495609,0.01597793,0.02206929,0.00188533,0.07472616,-0.00308726,-0.11761674,-0.10990943,-0.0837245,0.11459982,0.0218007,-0.01060996,0.02823082,-0.06582826,-0.06468157,-0.07658032,-0.01776498,-0.0117852,-0.01443133,0.03392917,0.00985017,-0.00809563,0.0896789,0.14416972,0.06838091,0.05609686,0.00748601,-0.00699252,-0.06507288,0.09070446,0.0034042,0.02057039,0.00687842,-0.00149804,0.10660566,-0.05199707,-0.02218304,0.1382817,0.0124255,-0.02728894,-0.04191913,0.03316831,0.06195587,-0.03698351,0.0034122,-0.0307687,-0.04259706,0.04388713,0.01490063,-0.00653583,-0.07682797,-0.06535277,-0.01203406,0.01548063,-0.03968563,0.00485384,0.07777452,-0.01870537,0.05364799,0.06121741,0.02838223,0.00154692,-0.03781504,-0.02171675,0.01910125,0.0611924,-0.03370856,0.05269524,0.03886386,0.03473247,0.01898679,0.03175719,-0.05081253,0.03719623,0.01967227,0.053029,-0.04708284,0.02780996,-0.06160692,-0.08150259,0.03040691,0.04070804,0.07754222,-0.05935907,-0.04650614,0.02815065,0.04313705,0.00446116,0.06011877,0.02856217,0.02087661,0.01493505,0.0866245,-0.02483269,-0.02565796,0.01662828,0.03390425,0.05464076,-0.00126702,-0.04843214,-0.01168148,0.03709241,-0.03037595,-0.0325114,0.02799937,0.01200577,-0.02604184,-0.01630996,-0.01597616,-0.0073702,0.02143076,0.03654407,-0.00927012,-0.02278504,0.00822262,0.01624951,-0.0305742,0.07110979,0.00581199,0.05940488,0.04770075,0.02955223,-0.02253401,-0.03618193,0.00107126,0.05602301,0.03671275,0.01305152,0.01184709,0.04125699,-0.05255732,-0.02278611,-0.00396731,0.0167336,0.02694554,0.03803422,-0.03669569,