INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('0be69d79-c1ac-4d3f-8f56-7535071630d9','md-morning-routine-phase-3-optimization-and-identity-weeks-9-16','Phase 3: Optimization and Identity (Weeks 9–16)

At this stage, the routine runs mostly on autopilot. The Phase 3 work is refinement and identity consolidation.

Identity language:
- Stop saying "I''''m trying to have a morning routine"
- Start saying "I''''m a morning person" or "Mornings are my most productive time"
- Identity statements change behavior because they define who you are, not just what you do

Seasonal adjustment:
- Winter mornings are harder — wake time may need to be 30 min later
- Summer mornings are easier — may extend routine naturally
- A routine that cannot survive winter is not stable — adjust proactively rather than letting it collapse

Monitoring without obsessing:
- Track consistency weekly (aim for 5 of 7 days minimum, not 7 of 7)
- 7 of 7 perfection creates fragility — one miss feels like failure
- 5 of 7 is 71% consistency and produces excellent long-term results

Impact assessment:
- After 90 days: does the morning routine actually affect the quality of your days?
- If yes: protect it fiercely — it is a keystone habit for the rest of the day
- If no: remove it and try a different time (some people are evening people — no routine is universal)

Milestone: Morning routine runs without conscious effort 80% of days. Identity statement: "I am someone who has a morning practice."','Coheren Domain KB — Morning Routine','{"skill-progression","lifestyle"}','{"phase","optimization","identity","weeks","stage","routine","runs","mostly","autopilot","work","refinement","consolidation","language","stop","saying"}','[0.06092131,0.03181458,0.00874058,0.02954471,-0.03674096,-0.12097127,-0.15750632,0.08350199,0.10702884,-0.16435139,-0.13611914,0.02379151,-0.06759349,0.04239484,0.03018461,0.0487577,0.00875463,-2.52e-05,0.07059391,0.01382155,-0.08923915,-0.03967901,-0.06215559,0.08414879,-0.00420162,0.04380026,0.03355379,-0.00478286,-0.04000888,-0.07209395,0.01385764,-0.06057899,-0.03030096,0.02669044,-0.00492932,-0.01160254,0.07550848,0.11731511,0.07672914,0.03359331,0.0460355,0.04024746,-0.04411105,0.09396724,0.00740503,0.00396801,0.00368811,0.07138413,0.09338462,-0.02606219,-0.00424732,0.07898866,0.02715638,-0.05531673,-0.0582931,0.02048824,0.07130411,-0.03766806,-0.03193771,-0.06708215,-0.01871043,0.07402012,-0.02463847,0.00768071,-0.05115842,-0.05145634,0.01982092,-0.00428975,-0.03831711,0.04891919,0.0480153,0.07538392,0.03354786,0.07491853,0.0081006,0.03504362,-0.0495376,-0.06727891,-0.04212888,0.04417148,-0.03395901,0.06592111,0.01170985,0.05934419,0.04187959,0.01857674,-0.09418687,-0.00814789,0.03454002,-0.02477777,-0.01117842,-0.01419637,-0.04439649,-0.04201181,0.01139301,0.05518331,0.03584052,-0.08288471,-0.04641843,0.00916036,0.05366258,-0.02503325,0.00604237,0.02799079,0.03834984,0.00617943,0.08897933,-0.04727339,-0.06842545,0.02214418,0.02087969,0.05188817,0.01051668,-0.02022991,-0.01986202,0.06884141,0.01754482,-0.01962279,0.06905459,0.02438005,-0.02506877,0.03004782,-0.02140186,-0.01285893,0.03690124,-0.01762692,0.02097965,-0.01355533,0.01632655,-0.02271864,-0.01214111,0.0536169,0.02336369,0.00548128,0.04472293,0.06808595,-0.03051306,-0.03619898,0.0076504,0.02282066,0.02001301,0.05749481,-0.00572347,0.01635193,