INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('a43c7546-7fb0-431c-b73b-f0ccc5ce72b7','md-strength-training-phase-2-progressive-overload-weeks-5-16','Phase 2: Progressive Overload (Weeks 5–16)

Progressive overload is the engine of strength. You must consistently add weight, reps, or sets over time. Without a tracking system, progress stalls.

The most effective beginner program structure (linear periodization):
- 3 days per week, full body (not splits)
- Core lifts: Squat, Deadlift, Bench, Row, Overhead Press
- Rep range: 5×5 or 3×8 — pick one and stick to it for 8 weeks

Linear progression protocol:
- Every session: add 2.5kg (5 lbs) to upper body lifts, 5kg (10 lbs) to lower body lifts
- When you fail to complete all sets: deload 10%, rebuild
- Track every session: date, exercise, weight, sets, reps, notes

Sample 3-day full body program:
Day A: Squat 3×5 → Bench 3×5 → Barbell Row 3×5
Day B: Squat 3×5 → Overhead Press 3×5 → Deadlift 1×5
Alternate A-B-A one week, B-A-B the next.

Milestone at week 12: Squat bodyweight for reps, deadlift 1.25× bodyweight, bench 0.75× bodyweight.

Nutrition non-negotiables:
- Protein: 1.6–2.2g per kg of bodyweight per day (muscle synthesis research consensus)
- Caloric surplus for muscle growth: 200-300 cal above maintenance
- Sleep: 7-9 hours — growth hormone peaks during deep sleep','Coheren Domain KB — Strength Training','{"skill-progression","kinesthetic"}','{"phase","progressive","overload","weeks","engine","strength","must","consistently","weight","reps","sets","over","time","without","tracking"}','[0.0795231,0.04689089,-0.04569255,0.06916887,-0.05264641,-0.00955355,-0.15196119,-0.02656043,0.0521621,-0.13179676,-0.06031034,-0.04183414,-0.12844115,-0.05347462,0.13851735,0.04338366,-0.02670969,0.02034822,0.05927777,-0.02944601,-0.1188024,-0.04968806,-0.06434566,0.1851779,0.00146241,0.00675549,-0.06700573,0.04145628,-0.07994027,-0.05767347,-0.01294011,0.08067849,0.0459168,0.0153153,0.01657178,-0.05324735,0.0669401,0.07958617,-0.03764195,0.01367862,0.02767499,-0.07337292,-0.03802364,0.09483727,0.0048661,0.01395928,0.05486894,-0.02252365,0.0372204,0.00031388,-0.02284061,0.05830642,-0.00387499,-0.00065153,-0.06219196,0.05029183,-0.02054041,-0.10855973,-0.04876581,-0.00902044,-0.03176161,0.03790383,0.02303862,0.05486517,-0.06034656,-0.03866226,-0.0087222,-0.04583038,-0.03379902,-0.02196149,0.1213742,0.02092311,0.11655611,0.0886798,0.01229562,0.00409822,-0.02459126,-0.03564419,0.00457644,0.03751974,-0.0409339,0.06529234,0.00582948,-0.02236973,0.03447784,0.02031882,-0.01797039,-0.03792071,-0.00961414,0.07930609,-0.02639879,0.03752366,-0.02065725,-0.07147029,0.04325723,0.00070234,-0.00299548,-0.03976624,-0.04012388,0.07234202,-0.02322485,0.00400779,-0.01898517,-0.03349883,-0.02576075,0.0565562,0.05735906,-0.00462214,-0.00165389,-0.018041,0.00119399,0.0114585,-0.00899809,-0.02859433,0.07284199,0.01319906,0.00566982,-0.01286522,0.03126926,0.07471032,-0.03337618,0.0037827,-0.01701375,0.00983075,0.04879225,0.01457722,0.00091466,-0.03244338,-0.0121533,-0.04558048,0.02323281,0.05170747,-0.03344025,-0.01832007,0.03330112,0.01153155,0.00537169,-0.01354696,-0.02817192,0.03586923,0.08147436,0.01570435,0.01396881,0.0184725,-0.04900379,-0.04259204,0.00102678,-0.01029611,0.03081998,0.0903521,0.01928175,