sis","md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-the-core-finding","md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-why-spacing-works-dual-mechanism","md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-the-testing-effect-retrieval-practice","md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-the-forgetting-curve-ebbinghaus-and-intervention-p","md-cepeda-spaced-repetition-interleaving-vs-blocking"}','2026-04-02T05:59:13.90755+00:00') ON CONFLICT (chunk_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('8d51c4a5-0064-474b-8ff3-00c6c3dbde9d','raptor_l1_cepeda_spaced_repetition_c2','The core insight shared across these passages is that optimal learning and retention are achieved through the strategic application of spaced repetition, retrieval practice, and sleep consolidation. This is rooted in the theory of the spacing effect, which suggests that information learned in multiple, spaced-out sessions is retained better than information learned in a single, massed session. Key researchers referenced include Cepeda et al., Roediger & Karpicke, and Walker. The most actionable finding for habit coaching is that introducing new content and reviewing it within 24 hours can increase 1-week retention by approximately 40%, and that spaced practice with sleep between sessions is critical for motor skill automaticity. By incorporating these principles into habit coaching, individuals can optimize their learning and retention of new skills and knowledge.','cepeda-spaced-repetition (summary)','{"habit-formation"}','{"application","habit","learning","curriculum","design","non-negotiable","first","rule","review","content","within","hours","exposure","single","produces","evidence","base","claims","specific","quantified","research","findings","cited","users","explaining","schedule","structured"}','[0.02129924,-0.0006163,0.00532282,-0.03728279,-0.00926952,0.01566818,-0.11537709,0.12561661,0.09159604,-0.11403199,-0.06197741,-0.06859723,-0.04120977,0.10073169,0.09516151,0.07184126,-0.03482863,-0.04180007,-0.00559974,-0.02058606,-0.06544018,0.00459325,-0.01928829,0.12582582,-0.00902839,-0.08079534,-0.03710382,-0.10534789,-0.07640862,0.00432157,-0.00113222,0.01982225,-0.07712839,0.05093683,0.08112016,-0.05874204,0.06828923