.01971757,-0.03050185,0.01314674,0.02481658,-0.00684967,-0.03732355,-0.01775637,0.00857678,0.02212018,-0.02516719,0.01446774,-0.02376634,-0.00262205,0.00346965,-0.00137764,-0.01849611,0.0075317,-0.00252993,-0.02641767,-0.00418665,-0.00800021,0.00640314,0.0185124,0.01315347,0.03278741,0.02038313,0.00924879,0.02187731,-0.02200267,0.00763732,0.02149962,0.02635624,0.0258206,0.01933038,-0.02521277,0.03725713,0.03112823,-0.01286501,0.0144751,-0.02401531,0.00060828,-0.0102602,0.01448369,0.01572146,-0.01843731,0.00350126,0.0013667,0.00099276,-0.01954794,-0.04130075,-0.0282718,-0.0037091,-0.02037284,-0.00238056,0.00378907,-0.04475405,0.01880481,-0.00837282,0.01830531,0.00553489,0.01956891,-0.00401456,-0.02085879,-0.01055514,0.01533896,-0.00304533,0.02819238,0.03030062,0.00647187,0.00898145,0.01723467]'::vector,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,'{}','raptor_summary',1,'{"md-music-phase-1-foundational-technique-weeks-1-6","md-music-phase-2-expanding-repertoire-and-music-theory-week","md-music-phase-3-performance-and-musicality-weeks-17-24","md-music-common-pitfalls"}','2026-04-02T06:08:36.817415+00:00') ON CONFLICT (chunk_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('a816d30c-1aa5-4d9e-89a9-8cf50ed7c067','raptor_l1_Coheren_Domain_KB___Video_Content_c1','The core insight shared across these passages is that success on YouTube is not solely dependent on high-quality equipment, but rather on developing a consistent and engaging content strategy. This is rooted in the concept of "minimum viable setup" and the idea that most successful channels started with equipment far below modern smartphones.

The key theory referenced is the "lean startup" approach, which emphasizes the importance of rapid experimentation and iteration in the development of a product or service. In the context of YouTube, this means focusing on the five learnable sub-skills of video production, including on-camera presence, camera operation, audio quality, editing, and thumbnails and titles.

The most actionable finding for habit coaching is that consistency beats frequency, and that publishing content regularly is more important than producing perfect videos. This means that creators should aim to publish at least one video per week, and ideally two videos per week after reaching 20 published videos. By focusing on consistency and engagement, creators can build a loyal audience and increase their chances of success on YouTube.','Coheren Domain KB — Video Content (summary)','{"skill-progression","creative"}','{"phase","equipment","process","first","videos","weeks","biggest","barrier","starting","youtube","channel","gear","perfectionism","camera","2021","volume","consistency","niche","clarity","algorithm","rewards","click-through","rate","publishes","week","months","monetization","growth","partner","program","requires","1000","subscribers","4000","watch","hours","most","channels","common","pitfalls","over","content","5000","scripting","thumbnails","performs","worse","iphone","good","ideas","comparing"}','[0.09540553,-0.03721635,0.04737037,-0.06548607,0.01163067,0.01991696,-0.11755794,0.1208707,-0.06717736,-0.06777319,-0.03887772,-0.03981723,0.05506636,0.0287201,0.06274327,0.05575484,-0.01872331,0.03910446,0.02921199,-0.08534522,-0.10731402,-0.00986333,0.03162902,0.10582554,0.03528863,-0.15475929,-0.00930599,-0.06364023,-0.06370806,-0.02948577,-0.01981224,-0.02427716,-0.06334496,0.08864778,0.00580685,-0.14570305,0.00683649,0.04283359,-0.01937374,0.03827663,0.04476449,0.03330364,-0.05247582,-0.039312,0.0447982,-0.01679471,0.02892813,0.00414585,-0.024408,-0.05739546,-0.01619624,0.05066866,-0.02835115,-0.02852164,-0.01576975,0.01374684,0.00898587,-0.0297386,0.06716158,-0.04076103,-0.05466096,0.00313752,-0.01717377,0.04873938,0.00438399,-0.04382269,-0.06121903,-0.01251407,-0.07678591,0.01328852,0.1028384,-0.00863715,-0.01449831,-0.02225362,-0.02087464,0.0306052,0.01505616,0.01068307,-0.00177769,-0.00162001,-0.05555817,-0.00199444,0.04605751,0.04135891,0.016528