42144,0.00660178,-0.01529929,0.02037599,0.00491303,0.00086908,0.01065711,0.00839809,0.00198969,0.00290376,0.0015401,-0.02217967,0.04199921,0.01468184,0.01503368,0.02918525,0.01483124,-0.01904975,0.00844386,-0.01486146,0.01605691,0.02726714,-0.0167356,0.01421012,0.00241674,0.03720276,0.00150094,0.02178216,0.00252933,0.02899743,0.00913514,-0.00916601,0.01502545,-0.00811918,0.0025299,-0.01442881,0.01922687,0.00072718,0.02216744,-0.0288985,0.01048484,-0.03602234,-0.00674889,0.01011927,0.0245158,0.02987924,-0.0362626,-0.00205051,0.02036165,0.00484435,-0.02265681,0.00192104,-0.00379012,-0.04582305,0.01763231,0.00459989,-0.02266892,0.02111682,0.00936083,0.0275368,-0.01765748,-0.02048299]'::vector,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{}',NULL,NULL,'{}','raptor_summary',1,'{"md-digital-detox-phase-2-intentional-architecture-weeks-3-8","md-digital-detox-phase-1-audit-and-awareness-weeks-1-2","md-digital-detox-phase-3-sustainable-digital-lifestyle-weeks-9-16","md-digital-detox-common-pitfalls"}','2026-04-02T06:09:01.179163+00:00') ON CONFLICT (chunk_id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO knowledge_chunks (id, chunk_id, content, source, categories, keywords, embedding, enriched_content, framework, content_type, applicable_stones, coaching_stage, evidence_level, emotion_context, chunk_type, raptor_level, raptor_source_ids, created_at) VALUES ('f7161da3-3f81-44a1-b659-90bfd569a103','raptor_l1_Coheren_Domain_KB___Writing_c1','The core insight shared across these passages is that building a writing habit requires a structured approach, separating drafting from editing, and focusing on volume before quality. This approach is rooted in the concept of "volume over quality" and is inspired by the work of writers such as Anne Lamott, who advocates for writing 1,000 words a day without editing.

The key theory referenced is the idea of "environment anchoring," where a consistent writing routine and environment help to establish a habit. The most actionable finding for habit coaching is the importance of setting a daily writing goal, such as 20 minutes a day, and sticking to it, even if the quality of the writing is not high. By doing so, writers can build momentum and eventually develop their craft through study and practice.','Coheren Domain KB — Writing (summary)','{"skill-progression","creative"}','{"phase","volume","over","quality","weeks","single","biggest","mistake","writers","make","editing","while","draft","separate","cognitive","craft","acquisition","after","builds","habit","study","improve","what","you''re","already","doing","practice","feedback","publishing","writing","without","readers","development","however","uncomfortable","moves","forward","common","pitfalls","drafting","destroys","momentum","trains","self-censorship","waiting","inspiration","professional","write","schedule"}','[0.06836583,0.01597368,0.08647769,-0.07181896,-0.08047818,-0.01061651,-0.06282172,0.12806141,0.12305873,-0.04157472,-0.07728903,-0.00072329,-0.04589891,0.07360458,0.03753593,0.08278325,0.02952282,-0.00454335,-0.00163859,-0.0294312,-0.11043932,0.03285212,-0.02681522,0.09415245,-0.01089673,-0.09606335,0.02490853,-0.14872351,-0.03183221,-0.05502022,0.01348865,0.04526309,-0.07481531,0.06172552,0.02200491,0.00267485,0.06304816,0.04547797,0.05711074,0.04462393,0.10262638,0.0705079,-0.03933737,0.01504115,0.04831332,0.03708403,0.06843942,-0.04394113,-0.01266268,-0.08204786,-0.00767472,0.06193487,-0.00294173,-0.03111262,-0.05504978,0.03943077,0.08381827,-0.04558339,0.06437185,-0.00476823,-0.06721607,-0.06841329,-0.03605234,0.03659275,0.03686771,-0.03672955,-0.00747241,-0.04404448,-0.08817741,-0.04201651,0.11388737,0.08986355,0.04315646,-0.01404915,-0.01131779,-0.02133589,0.00541265,-0.01910366,0.02830518,-0.01478924,-0.06642322,0.02054193,0.03188512,0.06986593,0.0018722,-0.061